{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0473_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "c18b84ac7c5be566a267c58f8e62b8bba59314a44901e8b7c9fa165921c6b812", "ja": "ええ。私なりに考えて、\n今回は『ギャップ』ってテーマにしてみたの。", "zh": "嗯。我按自己的想法考虑了一下，这次就试着以“反差”为主题。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0473_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "f45cd6f13a7de5fc9faec5f2e8bd7ea243d3a0ec85ad439fad00933bd6b8dbf3", "ja": "普段は大人カッコいいお姉さんが、\n家で可愛いパジャマを着ていたらときめくでしょ？", "zh": "平时是成熟帅气的大姐姐，\n要是在家穿着可爱的睡衣，会让人心动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
