{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_046rio0473_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_046rio0473_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "8b0d1d902a25bca27a0dd4b76bc2428920a6b157f03b3528c7801d7f5eea593d", "ja": "えっ……そ、そう？\nそう思ってもらえたならいいけど……。", "zh": "诶……是、是吗？\n你要是这么觉得，那就好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
